From 90d9fff34957a61dd88387ae9518542503e20492 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kire Soleski <noreply@regtech.local>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:26:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add Financial institutions module (finreg)

New sidebar menu after Overview with: overview dashboard, institutions
register, regulators, regulatory obligations, reports to regulators and
supervisory findings. New Django app `finreg` with models, API, CSV
export, role permissions; list/detail/edit pages and en/mk translations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015ac9CLnZGxKREEox5V9EBC
